---
import { NavLinks } from "../deed.config";
---

<footer class="bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto p-6 max-w-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-center text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
            <nav class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 *:underline *:font-medium">
                {NavLinks.map( item => <a href={item.HREF}>{item.NAME}</a>)}
            </nav>
            <div>以诚实、理性、尊重与开放为原则，书写中文互联网应有的文字与思想。</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>